# Local environment and diagnostic files.
#
# *.env covers the per-deployment files the live smoke targets read, which name
# a real deployment and the account signed into it. test/smoke/env.example is
# the checked-in template and does not match any of these patterns.
.env
.env.*
*.env
*.log

# Build and coverage output
/bin/
/build/
/dist/
/coverage/
*.out

# Locally built executables
/wso2
/wso2-module-reference
/modules/reference/wso2-module-reference

# Local workspace files
go.work.sum
